            "steps": [
              "Given: $\\cos\\left(-\\frac{23\\pi}{3}\\right)$. Goal: exact value.",
              "Cosine is even: $\\cos\\left(-\\frac{23\\pi}{3}\\right) = \\cos\\frac{23\\pi}{3}$",
              "$\\frac{23\\pi}{3} = 8\\pi - \\frac{\\pi}{3}$ (since $8\\pi = \\frac{24\\pi}{3}$).",
              "Remove four full turns: $\\cos\\frac{23\\pi}{3} = \\cos\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right) = \\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$",
              "So $\\cos\\left(-\\frac{23\\pi}{3}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}$."
            ],
            "finalAnswer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
            "solutionFigures": [],
